# STEP SCHOOL KIDS — web
# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit real values.

# Trial-lesson form → Telegram admins (see src/lib/telegram.ts and DEPLOYMENT.md §3).
# Server-only — never expose to the browser.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# Comma-separated: every id receives every application (user ids, or negative group ids).
TELEGRAM_CHAT_IDS=5810421271,5253204301

# With neither set, the form shows the call / Telegram fallback instead of pretending to send.
